          "quote": "应该优先挂心内科"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00153",
          "explanation": "Confirms the staged plan after the caregiver summarizes the sequence.",
          "quote": "您总结得非常准确"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The family conflict about eye versus heart follow-up and inability to do everything at once was converted into a staged plan: cardiology/heart testing first when necessary, eye follow-up retained, BP monitoring continued, and urgent thresholds preserved.",
