          "quote": "心内科医生开具阿司匹林"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00309",
          "explanation": "Doctor operationalizes the changed medication plan with timing and missed-dose advice.",
          "quote": "今晚就可以在饭后服用第一片"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "New information that cardiology had reviewed the reports and prescribed aspirin plus atorvastatin changed the plan from 'do not self-start' to a verified dosing schedule with bleeding precautions and continued eye follow-up.",
