          "quote": "血压：收缩压（高压）持续 ≥ 180 mmHg"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met: the episode repeatedly checked absence of new eye, neurologic, cardiac, and severe BP symptoms and instructed urgent care if such signs appeared.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor links retinal artery occlusion to systemic vascular risk rather than treating it as only an eye problem.",
          "quote": "必须对潜在的血管危险因素进行全面评估"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00069",
          "explanation": "Doctor avoids converting ECG abnormality into confirmed cardiac thrombus.",
          "quote": "不代表一定有心脏血栓"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met: ophthalmology follow-up and systemic cardiovascular/BP evaluation were both emphasized, while atrial fibrillation or thrombus was not assumed from the initial ECG.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00028",
          "explanation": "Doctor attempted broad record reconciliation for discharge summary, tests, medications, and timeline.",
          "quote": "完整的用药清单（包括出院带药）"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00240",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked the caregiver to read exact Holter and echo conclusion sections before making decisions.",
          "quote": "完整地、一字不差地念出来"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met: the doctor queried records and repeatedly asked the family to read or verify discharge, ECG/Holter, echo, medication, and follow-up details, then refined the plan based on what was found.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00069",
          "explanation": "Doctor sets the core antithrombotic safety boundary.",
          "quote": "绝对不能自行加用抗凝药"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00287",
          "explanation": "Doctor requires pharmacy/label verification for dose and frequency.",
          "quote": "药名、剂量（比如一片是多少毫克）、一天几次"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met: the doctor repeatedly warned against self-starting anticoagulants or antiplatelets before clinician decision, distinguished later aspirin from anticoagulation, and required medication-list/pharmacy verification.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
