          "explanation": "Doctor gives a home BP monitoring schedule.",
          "quote": "今晚睡前、明天起床后、以及明天出门就诊前"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "Doctor directs clinician review of the antihypertensive plan.",
          "quote": "拜新同剂量要不要调整"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 is met: home BP monitoring, continuation without unsupervised dose changes, and cardiology review of the antihypertensive plan were all addressed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
