          "event_id": "lite_evt_00069",
          "explanation": "Doctor names follow-up owners and prioritization.",
          "quote": "尽快推进心内科的专科评估和心脏超声检查"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00287",
          "explanation": "Doctor maintains ophthalmology follow-up despite cardiology treatment.",
          "quote": "眼科复查绝对不能取消"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met: the plan included cardiology/internal medicine review, heart echo/Holter, ophthalmology follow-up, documents/medication boxes to bring, and urgent fallback thresholds.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
