          "event_id": "lite_evt_00153",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms caregiver teach-back of the staged plan.",
          "quote": "您总结得非常准确，一字不差"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00329",
          "explanation": "Doctor confirms the caregiver has organized medication, risk recognition, and follow-up execution.",
          "quote": "保持这个状态，按时服药，注意观察"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC7 is met: the caregiver repeatedly taught back the plan, roles were practically assigned around bringing documents, booking/attending visits, checking medications, and monitoring BP, and the doctor confirmed executability.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
