          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly retracts/pauses a provisional Holter interpretation until formal report review.",
          "quote": "暂时搁置，等待正式报告"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00287",
          "explanation": "Doctor distinguishes antiplatelet aspirin from anticoagulants after cardiology prescription.",
          "quote": "阿司匹林属于“抗血小板”药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC8 is met: the doctor did not invent atrial fibrillation, anticoagulation, doses, or appointments; uncertainty was maintained until records or clinician decisions were available, and medication classes were corrected after prescription verification.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
